<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">Strategic synthesis</h3>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">This week strengthens a narrower thesi=
s than =E2=80=9Chealthcare automation is growing.=E2=80=9D Capital and buyer =
attention are concentrating around systems that control an economically conse=
quential junction:</p>
<ul style=3D"margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:22px;">
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">authorization before the claim;</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">broker distribution before enrollment;=
</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">care orchestration before avoidable ut=
ilization;</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">state funding before rural technology =
procurement.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The winners are more likely to be plat=
forms that can prove downstream financial outcomes across these junctions. Ac=
cess, distribution and workflow ownership are becoming as important as model =
accuracy.</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">What I'm Watching Next</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:22px;">
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
