or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">Bottom Line</h3>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The most important weekly change is th=
at prior authorization is becoming embedded infrastructure across both EHR an=
